{%- comment -%}
  fye-pdx-enquire: the product enquiry popup on the redesigned product page
  (CRO handoff §8, 27/09/2026). Rendered once per page by fye-pdx-ring and
  fye-pdx-stone, OUTSIDE the product form (forms cannot nest).

  It is an ordinary fye-popups dialog in every way that matters, so it needs
  no new plumbing:
    · key `pdx-enquire`, opened by any data-fye-popup="pdx-enquire" (Speak to
      us, "Need it sooner?", "We'll help you choose", the offer box);
    · Shopify's own {% form 'contact' %}, so an enquiry arrives at hello@
      like every other;
    · fye-ui.js composes contact[body] on submit from every
      [data-fye-popup-line] field, the message and the page it came from,
      because custom contact[] fields do not show usefully in the email
      (fye-popups header);
    · after sending, the same reopen-on-success and reopen-on-error.
  It reuses the .pop classes from fye-popups' stylesheet for the same reason.

  What is new: the product strip at the top and the "Product" and "Selection"
  lines are filled by fye-ui.js AT THE MOMENT IT OPENS, from the live buy
  box, so the enquiry says which metal, quality, size and stone the shopper
  was looking at. With JS off they carry the product title and URL.

  "How would you like to talk?" posts as its own line. Consultation is one of
  the four, as the handoff has it; a shopper who wants the diary straight
  away still has the Contact us popup's Book consultation button.

  No consent tickbox: the handoff drops it on this form, and nothing here
  subscribes anyone to anything.

  Parameters: product, noun ('ring' | 'diamond' | …), price (pennies)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign p = product
  assign label = 'Product enquiry: ' | append: p.title
-%}
<dialog class="pop pdx-enq" id="fye-popup-pdx-enquire"
        data-fye-popup-panel="pdx-enquire"
        data-fye-popup-label="{{ label | escape }}"
        aria-label="Enquire about this {{ noun }}">
  <div class="pop__in pop__in--noimage">
    <div class="pop__body">
      <button class="pop__close" type="button" data-fye-popup-close aria-label="Close">
        {%- render 'icon', name: 'close', size: 18 -%}
      </button>

      {%- form 'contact', id: 'pop-form-pdx-enquire', class: 'pop__form' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <div class="pop__done" data-fye-popup-done tabindex="-1">
            <span class="pop__done-mark">{%- render 'icon', name: 'check', size: 22 -%}</span>
            <p class="pop__title" role="heading" aria-level="2">Thank you</p>
            <div class="pop__intro"><p>A jeweller will reply personally, usually within one working day.</p></div>
            <button class="btn btn--outline" type="button" data-fye-popup-close>Close</button>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="pop__title" role="heading" aria-level="2">Enquire about this {{ noun }}</p>
          <div class="pop__intro"><p>A jeweller will reply personally, usually within one working day.</p></div>

          {%- if form.errors -%}
            <div class="pop__errors" id="pop-err-pdx-enquire" role="alert" tabindex="-1" data-fye-popup-error>
              <p>{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="pdx-enq__strip">
            {%- if p.featured_image != blank -%}
              {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 128 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', width: 64, height: 64, alt: '', class: 'pdx-enq__thumb' }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="pdx-enq__words">
              <span class="pdx-enq__name"><span data-pdx-enq-title>{{ p.title }}</span> · <span data-pdx-enq-price>{{ price | money }}</span></span>
              <span class="pdx-enq__sel" data-pdx-enq-sel></span>
            </span>
          </div>

          <input type="hidden" value="{{ p.title | escape }} ({{ shop.url }}{{ p.url }})" data-fye-popup-line="Product" data-pdx-enq-product>
          <input type="hidden" value="" data-fye-popup-line="Selection" data-pdx-enq-selection>
          <input type="hidden" value="" data-fye-popup-line="About" data-pdx-enq-topic>

          <fieldset class="pdx-enq__how">
            <legend class="pdx-enq__legend">How would you like to talk?</legend>
            <div class="pdx-enq__seg" role="radiogroup" aria-label="How would you like to talk?">
              {%- assign ways = 'Call me,WhatsApp,Email,Consultation' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- for w in ways -%}
                <button type="button" role="radio" class="pdx-enq__way{% if forloop.first %} is-on{% endif %}" aria-checked="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-pdx-way="{{ w }}">{{ w }}</button>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <input type="hidden" name="contact[Preferred contact]" value="Call me" data-fye-popup-line="Preferred contact" data-pdx-way-input>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="pop__pair">
            <div class="pop__field">
              <label for="pdx-enq-name">Name</label>
              <input id="pdx-enq-name" type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" data-fye-popup-line="Name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="pop__field">
              <label for="pdx-enq-email">Email address</label>
              <input id="pdx-enq-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required
                     {%- if form.errors contains 'email' %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="pop-err-pdx-enquire"{% endif %}>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pop__pair">
            <div class="pop__field">
              <label for="pdx-enq-phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="pdx-enq-phone" type="tel" name="contact[phone]" autocomplete="tel" data-fye-popup-line="Phone">
            </div>
            <div class="pop__field">
              <label for="pdx-enq-when">When do you need it?</label>
              <select id="pdx-enq-when" name="contact[When needed]" data-fye-popup-line="When needed">
                <option>Not sure yet</option>
                <option>Within 1 month</option>
                <option>1 to 3 months</option>
                <option>3 to 6 months</option>
                <option>6 months or more</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pop__field">
            <label for="pdx-enq-message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="pdx-enq-message" name="contact[Message]" rows="3" data-fye-popup-message
                      placeholder="Anything we should know: a date, a budget, a question about this {{ noun }}"></textarea>
          </div>

          <input type="hidden" name="contact[body]" value="{{ label | escape }} (sent from {{ request.path }})" data-fye-popup-body>

          <div class="pop__send">
            <button class="btn btn--block pop__submit" type="submit">Send enquiry</button>
            <p class="pop__note">Your details are kept private and used only to reply to you.</p>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>
